      },
      {
        "q": "Are these body or garment measurements?",
        "a": "Garment. Every number in the table is the finished piece laid flat and measured — chest is measured across and doubled. That is why they read larger than your own chest."
      },
      {
        "q": "How accurate is \"Find my size\"?",
        "a": "It estimates your chest from your height, weight and build, then matches it against how this particular style is cut. It gets most people right, but it cannot see you — if you already own something that fits the way you like, comparing it to the table will always beat the estimate."
      },
      {
        "q": "Can I exchange if the fit is wrong?",
        "a": "Yes. Sizes can be exchanged within 7 days of delivery, unworn and with tags on. Reach us on WhatsApp or at support@theonrepeat.co and we'll arrange the pickup."
      },
      {
        "q": "Will it shrink in the wash?",
        "a": "Our cottons are pre-shrunk, so expect very little movement. Cold machine wash inside out and dry in the shade to keep it that way."
      }
    ]
  },
